WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Starting a quiet habit is often harder than wanting one.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A twelve-minute timer can make the first step concrete.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
You can try that free before buying any audio.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 sells short recordings in different listening styles.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
That does not prove an hour of meditation fits into twelve minutes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Compare the edition, evidence, alternatives and actual terms before you choose.
